|  | Fast Interconnect (NVLink: 900GB/s) | Slow Interconnect (PCI-E: 128 GB/s) | Dual-node Heterogeneous Interconnect (NVLink:900GB/s, IB:50GB/s) |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| SemMoE: Averaged E2E Latency (s) | 1.284 | 4.795 | 8.085 |
| Baseline: Averaged E2E Latency (s) | 1.525 | 6.491 | 11.102 |
| Latency Reduction | **15.8%** | **26.1%** | **27.2%** |

